"char_end": 306,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 16.2,
"end": 21.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is the task management tool built for speed – designed for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 307,
"char_end": 386,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 21.06,
"end": 22.74,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 387,
"char_end": 408,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.74,
"end": 30.9,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we get into the topic, Rafael Vasconcelos was on the show to discuss how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 409,
"char_end": 545,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.9,
"end": 31.86,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 561,
"char_end": 574,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 31.92,
"end": 34.02,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 575,
"char_end": 628,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 34.02,
"end": 39.96,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point out something – Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 646,
"char_end": 744,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.56,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 745,
"char_end": 772,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.62,
"end": 214.98,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 773,
"char_end": 823,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 214.98,
"end": 220.68,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking bigger risks.",
"char_start": 839,
"char_end": 930,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 220.74,
"end": 223.14,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 931,
"char_end": 974,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 223.2,
"end": 226.38,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 975,
"char_end": 1044,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 226.38,
"end": 227.7,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1062,
"char_end": 1095,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 227.76,
"end": 231.12,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1096,
"char_end": 1146,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 231.12,
"end": 231.48,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1162,
"char_end": 1172,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 231.54,
"end": 237.78,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 1173,
"char_end": 1270,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 237.84,
"end": 241.86,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Understanding the setup is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1271,
"char_end": 1361,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 241.86,
"end": 242.88,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1379,
"char_end": 1397,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.94,
"end": 246.3,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1398,
"char_end": 1448,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 246.3,
"end": 252.78,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1464,
"char_end": 1579,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 252.84,
"end": 255.18,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1580,
"char_end": 1622,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 255.24,
"end": 259.26,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up rebuilding everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1623,
"char_end": 1705,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 259.26,
"end": 261.36,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1723,
"char_end": 1750,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 261.36,
"end": 265.62,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1766,
"char_end": 1842,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 265.68,
"end": 269.76,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1843,
"char_end": 1914,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 269.76,
"end": 272.16,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 1932,
"char_end": 1972,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.22,
"end": 275.16,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1973,
"char_end": 2019,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 275.16,
"end": 275.82,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2035,
"char_end": 2055,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 275.88,
"end": 282.48,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections can change the optimal racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 2056,
"char_end": 2184,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 282.54,
"end": 286.86,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2185,
"char_end": 2251,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 286.86,
"end": 291.78,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
