"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 5091,
"char_end": 5147,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 1367.7,
"end": 1370.22,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5163,
"char_end": 5214,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 1370.28,
"end": 1375.92,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5215,
"char_end": 5320,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 1375.98,
"end": 1378.74,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this pattern in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5321,
"char_end": 5378,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 1378.8,
"end": 1381.98,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5379,
"char_end": 5441,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 1381.98,
"end": 1383.48,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 5459,
"char_end": 5476,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 1383.48,
"end": 1392.06,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "And when teams adopt the Spoke & Wrench methodology within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5492,
"char_end": 5661,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 1392.06,
"end": 1394.46,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 5679,
"char_end": 5719,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 1394.52,
"end": 1397.52,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 5720,
"char_end": 5776,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 1397.52,
"end": 1398.18,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5792,
"char_end": 5812,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 1398.24,
"end": 1404.84,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections influence the choice of trajectory between training sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 5813,
"char_end": 5941,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 1404.9,
"end": 1408.08,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5942,
"char_end": 6008,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
"end": 1685.16,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6026,
"char_end": 6093,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 1685.16,
"end": 1689.24,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6109,
"char_end": 6173,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 1689.3,
"end": 1690.44,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6174,
"char_end": 6203,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 1690.44,
"end": 1694.1,
